# Dissection Practice targets Bot2 and Bot2's Ornithopter (-1/-1, no +1/+1). Bot2 answers by Lightning Bolting its own Ornithopter,
# so one of the two targets is illegal when the spell resolves (CR 608.2b) - the other is not, so the spell still resolves and does
# what it can: Bot2 loses 1 life and Bot1 gains 1. The creature is simply gone; nothing is pumped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Dissection Practice
Swamp x5
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Lightning Bolt
Ornithopter
Mountain x4
Mountain x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dissection Practice.Cast
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Target()
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot1.Life = 21
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter; Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
Bot1.Graveyard = Dissection Practice
